 "headline": "No agent has enough conversations for a fair individual comparison, so I've flagged conversations for review instead. Across the workforce, only 29.3% of negative customer turns got an acknowledgement or apology.",
 "answer": "3215 of 10966 negative customer turns were followed by an empathetic agent reply (29.3%), and 1340 of 2338 assessable closing actions did not fit the customer's issue (57.3%). Highest-priority conversations for a coaching review: C0006890 (AgentHLKJ, Paid but service not delivered: 7 negative customer turns, 0 acknowledged); C0009233 (AgentCLKH, General help request: 7 negative customer turns, 0 acknowledged); C0002671 (AgentSHVG, General help request: 6 negative customer turns, 0 acknowledged). This is decision support: a team lead should read these transcripts before any coaching conversation.",
